Selection: Colored
Draws the selected row in the Selected Color. Off draws it in the same color as the other rows.
Selection: Cursor
Draws the small bar at the left edge of the selected row. Themes that underline the row have no cursor.
Selection: Highlight
Draws the bar behind the selected row, or the line under it in themes that use one.
Show Legend
Shows the button legend at the bottom of the menu and the info page. Off hides it in every theme; the buttons still work.
User Wallpaper
Draws wallpaper.png from the folder your settings are saved in behind the menu pages, in any theme. 512x512 at most, 8-bit (256 colour) palette.
Ambient Effects
Shows the seamless crystal light scene, plus a short convergence when launching. Off keeps static backgrounds and the original launch fade.
User Wallpaper: no wallpaper.png in the settings folder. The theme's background is shown.
User Wallpaper: wallpaper.png must be 512x512 at most with an 8-bit (256 colour) palette. The theme's background is shown.
      Paramètres MMCE
POPSTARTER connects with SMBv1 for this game. The server in POPSTARTER Network Settings must accept SMBv1.
Exit To
PS2 Browser: opens the Browser, keeping the card's menu program (FMCB, OSDMenu) whenever it allows. OSDSYS (Skip Update): the console menu without the card's menu program. OSDSYS (With Update): the console's own exit. BOOT choices: run the named ELF from mc0:/BOOT, then mc1:/BOOT if needed.
